        "webwork-opl:FM6.9"
       ],
       "do": "Compute a Reynolds number and a hydraulic diameter, and say what each common dimensionless group compares.",
       "ek": [
        "Re = ρvD/μ; D_h = 4A/P; Re, Fr, We, Ma, Eu each compare two forces or speeds."
